# Tapping an author lists their other books across both libraries; the book's
# own bar leads to its neighbours. Back walks the way it came, book by book.
clean
tap Mensonges
wait-for Book details
expect More by this author
expect Marilou Addison
clean
tap Marilou Addison
wait-for Books by Marilou Addison
expect Résolument moi !
expect Page 1
clean
tap Previous page
expect Page 1
tap Un dernier arrêt avant Noël
wait-for Book details
clean
tap Back
wait-for Books by Marilou Addison
tap Back
wait-for Book details
tap Similar
wait-for Like Mensonges
expect Les mains sur le volant
expect Page 1
clean
tap Back
wait-for Book details
tap Back
wait-for Prêt numérique
